# Networking task

Task: Set the static hostname of this system to `{{new_hostname}}`. The hostname must be in effect now and must persist across reboots.

Additionally, configure local name resolution in `/etc/hosts` so that the following names resolve to the given addresses, with the fully qualified name and the short name on the same entry:

- `{{fqdn_a}}` and `{{host_a}}` -> `{{ip_a}}`
- `{{fqdn_b}}` and `{{host_b}}` -> `{{ip_b}}`

Do not remove any existing entries from `/etc/hosts`.
